lopment and regulates, for instance, lymphoblast proliferation (PubMed:23178126)."}],"uniprot_source":"UniProtKB/Swiss-Prot Function, release 2026_03","retrieved":"2026-10-21"}],"structures":[],"alphafold_accessions":[]}